[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the fuse access cover where it says &quot;PUSH&quot;.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/1295.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<p>1. Release the pins (1a) from the housing and remove the fuse access cover (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/1296.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Check that the fuse access cover attachment pins are not damaged.</p><p>- Fit the fuse access cover in the housing and close it.</p>"]]